#. type: Content of: <para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/scrollkeeper-dir.xml:6
msgid ""
"<parameter>--localstatedir=/var/lib</parameter>: This parameter is used so "
"that all <application>ScrollKeeper</application> files are installed in, and"
" the <application>ScrollKeeper</application> database is properly updated in"
" <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lib/scrollkeeper</filename> instead of "
"some files being installed in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$GNOME_PREFIX/var/scrollkeeper</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--localstatedir=/var/lib</parameter>: Esse parâmetro é usado de "
"forma que todos os arquivos do <application>ScrollKeeper</application> sejam "
"instalados e a base de dados do <application>ScrollKeeper</application> seja "
"atualizada corretamente em <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lib/"
"scrollkeeper</filename> em vez de alguns arquivos serem instalados em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$GNOME_PREFIX/var/scrollkeeper</filename>."
